## Adapted source

The following files were adapted from `@linxin666/dsh-usage` (Apache License 2.0),
whose source is redistributed inside the package:

- `src/mount-once.ts` — adapted from `src/mount-once.ts`. That file is itself
  generated by `scripts/sync-shared.mjs` from a shared `shared/host/mount-once.ts`
  source; the semantics (global-symbol registry, `ctx.effect` disposer contract)
  are preserved deliberately so both plugins share one verdict in a process.

The loopback trust fence and bounded-JSON response helpers that this plugin will
use from M1 onward (`src/host/loopback.ts`, `src/host/http.ts`) are likewise
family-shared sources in `@linxin666/dsh-usage`. They are intended to be copied
rather than reimplemented, because the security semantics of the fence must not
drift between plugins; when they land they will carry the same origin header as
`src/mount-once.ts`. See `DESIGN.md` §13.1.1.

